+# Credit Control Feature - Implementation Summary
+
+## Deliverables
+
+This implementation provides a complete foundation for webERP's credit control feature, addressing all requirements in the Business Requirements Document (BRD).
+
+### ✅ What Has Been Implemented
+
+#### 1. Database Schema (10 Tables)
+All tables created in `/install/sql/tables/`:
+- **creditreviews.sql** - Record credit review history with decisions and new limits
+- **creditstatus.sql** - Track stop/watch status changes with audit trail
+- **reminderlettersconfig.sql** - Configure escalating reminder letter stages
+- **reminderlettersent.sql** - Record each reminder letter sent
+- **interestfeeconfig.sql** - System-wide interest rate and fee configuration
+- **interestfeesposted.sql** - Monthly interest/fee charges with GL posting links
+- **creditwriteoffs.sql** - Bad debt write-offs with approval workflow
+- **creditdisputedinvoices.sql** - Mark invoices as disputed (exclude from reminders/charges)
+- **creditcustomerexemptions.sql** - Exempt customers from interest/fees by date range
+- **creditcontrolactions.sql** - Complete audit trail of all credit actions
+
+#### 2. Database Migration
+- **sql/updates/44.php** - Adds three columns to debtorsmaster (creditstatus, nextreviewdate, lastreviewed) and creates all 10 new tables
+
+#### 3. Core Functions
+- **includes/CreditControlFunctions.php** - Reusable helper functions for:
+  - Status checks (GetCustomerCreditStatus, IsCustomerOnStop, IsCustomerOnWatch)
+  - Balance calculations (GetCustomerBalance, GetCustomerOverdueBalance)
+  - Order validation (CheckCreditStop, CheckCreditWatch, CheckCreditLimitWithOrder)
+  - Reminder management (ShouldSendReminder, GetLastReminderStage)
+  - Audit trail recording (RecordCreditAction)
+
+#### 4. Credit Control Pages (2 Fully Implemented)
+
+**CreditReviews.php**
+- Search for customers by name/code
+- View customer credit details (limit, status, history)
+- Record new credit review with:
+  - Decision (limit confirmed/raised/reduced, watch/stop changes)
+  - New credit limit (optional)
+  - Free-text notes
+  - Next review date
+- View complete immutable review history
+- Automatically updates debtorsmaster with new limits and status
+
+**CreditStatus.php**
+- Search for customers
+- Display current status with color coding (red=on_stop, yellow=watch)
+- Change status with required reason
+- Records in creditstatus table for audit trail
+
+#### 5. Documentation
+
+**NOTES.md** (Complete Technical Documentation)
+- Detailed description of all 10 database tables
+- Schema extensions to debtorsmaster
+- Migration script operation
+- Helper functions reference
+- Integration points (5 critical pages identified)
+- Design decisions with rationale (9 key decisions documented)
+- Open questions from BRD with recommendations
+- Transition plan (7 phases)
+- Data migration process from legacy stop list
+- Testing checklist
+- Files created and still to implement
+
+**INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md** (Step-by-Step Integration)
+- Exact code locations and changes needed for SelectOrderItems.php (order blocking)
+- Integration snippets for ConfirmDispatch_Invoice.php, CounterSales.php, EDI processing, standing orders
+- Menu integration examples
+- Security token setup
+- Testing procedures for each integration point
+- Rollback procedure
+- Legacy hold system transition strategy
+
+**IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md** (This file)
+- Overview of deliverables
+- Next steps for completion
+- Architecture overview
+- Feature mapping to BRD requirements
