+# Credit Control Integration Guide
+
+This guide shows exactly where and how to integrate credit control checks into existing webERP pages.
+
+## Critical Integration: SelectOrderItems.php
+
+This is the most important integration - it blocks orders for customers on credit stop.
+
+### Location: After customer details are retrieved (around line 539)
+
+**Current code (lines 536-510):**
+```php
+	if (DB_num_rows($Result) > 0) {
+		$MyRow = DB_fetch_array($Result);
+
+		if ($MyRow['dissallowinvoices'] == 0){
+			// Customer details loaded successfully
+			$_SESSION['Items'.$identifier]->CustomerName = $MyRow[0];
+			...
+		} else {
+			prnMsg(__('The') . ' ' . htmlspecialchars($MyRow[0], ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8', false) . ' ' . __('account is currently on hold please contact the credit control personnel to discuss'),'warn');
+		}
+	}
+```
+
+**Required changes:**
+
+1. **Add include at top of file (after line 19, with other includes):**
+```php
+include('includes/CreditControlFunctions.php');
+```
+
