+2. **To full rollback (emergency):**
+   - Would require reverse migration script
+   - Keep debtorsmaster.creditstatus, creditlimit, nextreviewdate columns (low risk)
+   - Drop new tables if needed (rare)
+   - Restore debtorsmaster.holdreason functionality as backup hold mechanism
