+## Transition: Legacy Hold Reason System
+
+Current webERP uses `debtorsmaster.holdreason` and `holdreasons.dissallowinvoices` for holds.
+
+**To maintain backward compatibility:**
+
+1. **During migration:** When customer is on stop, also set `holdreason = 1` (some pre-defined hold reason for credit stop)
+2. **In code:** Both systems check:
+   - Check new creditstatus column first (preferred)
+   - Fall back to holdreason if creditstatus is null (legacy)
+3. **Transition period:** Maintain both, gradually migrate customers to new system
+
+**Example of dual-check logic:**
+```php
+$Status = GetCustomerCreditStatus($DebtorNo);
+if ($Status == 'on_stop') {
+	// Use new system
+	prnMsg(__('Customer on stop via credit control'), 'error');
+} elseif (is customer has legacy holdreason) {
+	// Use old system
+	prnMsg(__('Customer on hold'), 'warn');
+}
+```
