+# Credit Control Feature Implementation
+
+## Overview
+This document describes the credit control feature implementation for webERP, addressing all requirements in the Business Requirements Document (BRD). The feature provides comprehensive credit management including reviews, stop/watch status, overdue reminders, interest/late fees, and bad debt write-offs.
+
+## Database Schema Changes
+
+### New Tables Created
+
+All new tables are InnoDB with UTF8MB4 charset to match webERP conventions.
+
+#### 1. `creditreviews`
+Records the history of credit reviews for customers. Each review documents:
+- Review date and reviewer
+- Credit decision (limit confirmed/raised/reduced, watch/stop status changes)
+- New credit limit (if changed)
+- Free-text notes
+- Next review date
+- Immutable audit trail (no updates/deletes allowed to old reviews)
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `id` (PK, auto-increment)
+- `debtorno` (FK to debtorsmaster)
+- `reviewdate`, `decision`, `newcreditlimit`, `notes`, `nextreviewdate`
+- `reviewedby`, `created_at` (audit)
+
+#### 2. `creditstatus`
+Tracks current and historical credit status changes. Maintains a complete audit trail of all stop/watch changes with who changed it, when, and why.
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `id` (PK), `debtorno` (FK)
+- `status` (enum: normal, watch, on_stop)
+- `reason` (text explaining the change)
+- `changedby`, `changeddate`, `effective_from` (audit)
+
+**Design decision:** Status history is kept in separate table rather than debtorsmaster to maintain immutable audit trail and support historical queries.
+
+#### 3. `reminderlettersconfig`
+Configures escalating reminder letter stages (e.g., 14 days overdue = stage 1, 30 days = stage 2, 45 days = stage 3). Finance can define:
+- Number of stages
+- Days overdue to trigger each stage
+- Email subject and body template
+- Active/inactive flag
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `id` (PK), `stage` (unique)
+- `daysoverdue`, `subject`, `body`, `active`
+
+#### 4. `reminderlettersent`
+Records every reminder letter sent for audit trail and customer visibility. Captures:
+- Date/time sent
+- Reminder stage
+- Invoices covered
+- Amount overdue
+- Email address and sender
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `id` (PK), `debtorno` (FK)
+- `stage`, `sentdate`, `remindertext`, `invoicescovered`, `overdue_amount`
+- `email_to`, `sent_by` (audit)
+
+#### 5. `interestfeeconfig`
+Stores system-wide interest rate and late fee configuration. Finance can define:
+- Annual interest rate (%)
+- Fixed late fee amount
+- Fee type (fixed per month or per invoice)
+- Days overdue before charging
+- GL accounts to post charges to
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `interest_rate`, `late_fee`, `fee_type`
+- `days_overdue_before_charge`
+- `interest_glcode`, `fee_glcode` (for GL posting)
+
+#### 6. `interestfeesposted`
+Records monthly interest and fee charges for each customer. Includes:
+- Period (YYYY-MM format)
+- Interest and fee amounts
+- GL and debtortrans IDs (for reversals/corrections)
+- Unique constraint prevents duplicate charges in same month
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `debtorno` (FK), `charge_period` (YYYY-MM)
+- `interest_amount`, `fee_amount`
+- `interest_gltrans_id`, `fee_gltrans_id` (links for GL reconciliation)
+- `posted_by`, `posted_date` (audit)
+- `exempt_customer` flag
+
+#### 7. `creditwriteoffs`
+Records bad debt write-offs with approval workflow. Includes:
+- Write-off amount and currency
+- Reason and approver notes
+- Status tracking (pending_approval, approved, rejected, reversed)
+- GL and debtortrans IDs for posting
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `debtorno` (FK), `amount`, `currency`, `reason`
+- `writeoff_by`, `writeoff_date` (audit)
+- `approval_required`, `approved_by`, `approved_date`, `status`
+- `gltrans_id`, `debtortrans_id` (GL posting links)
+
+#### 8. `creditdisputedinvoices`
+Allows credit control to mark invoices as disputed so they are:
+- Not included in reminder letters
+- Not charged interest/fees
+- Tracked for resolution
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `debtortrans_id` (unique FK)
+- `debtorno` (FK)
+- `disputed_date`, `dispute_reason`
+- `resolved`, `resolved_date`, `resolved_by` (audit)
+
+#### 9. `creditcustomerexemptions`
+Exempts specific customers from interest and/or late fees, with:
+- Effective date range
+- Reason
+- Who set the exemption
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `debtorno` (FK)
+- `exempt_interest`, `exempt_fees` (boolean flags)
+- `effective_from`, `effective_to`
+- `set_by`, `set_date` (audit)
+
+#### 10. `creditcontrolactions`
+Audit trail of all credit control actions for regulatory compliance and investigation.
+
+**Key fields:**
+- `debtorno` (FK)
+- `action_type` (enum: review, status_change, reminder_sent, charge_posted, writeoff, dispute_added)
+- `details` (JSON or free text)
+- `user_id`, `action_date` (audit)
+
+### Schema Extensions
+
+#### Modified: `debtorsmaster`
+Added three new columns to track credit control state:
+
+1. **`creditstatus`** (enum: normal, watch, on_stop)
+   - Default: 'normal'
+   - Reflects current status for order blocking logic
+   - Updated when `creditstatus` table entry is made
+   - Design: Denormalized here for performance in order entry checks
+
+2. **`nextreviewdate`** (date)
+   - When the next credit review is due
+   - Set during account creation (default 12 months out)
+   - Updated after each review
+   - Used by credit review dashboard to prioritize work
+
+3. **`lastreviewed`** (datetime)
+   - When account was last reviewed
+   - Used to identify customers never reviewed
+   - Updated after each review
+
+**Note:** Existing `creditlimit` and `holdreason` columns are retained for backward compatibility. The new system works alongside the legacy hold reason system during transition.
+
+## Database Migration Script
+
+### `sql/updates/44.php`
+Runs during system upgrade to:
+
+1. Add three columns to `debtorsmaster`
+2. Create nine new tables
+3. Insert default reminder letter configuration (3 stages)
+4. Insert default interest/fee configuration
+5. Initialize `nextreviewdate` for all existing customers (12 months from today)
+
+**Execution:** Follows webERP's numbered update pattern with proper error checking via `$_SESSION['Updates']['Errors']` and `UpdateDBNo()`.
+
+## Helper Functions
+
+### `includes/CreditControlFunctions.php`
+Provides reusable functions for credit control checks throughout the application:
+
+- **Status checks:**
+  - `GetCustomerCreditStatus($DebtorNo)` - returns current status
+  - `IsCustomerOnStop($DebtorNo)` - boolean check
+  - `IsCustomerOnWatch($DebtorNo)` - boolean check
+  - `CheckCreditStop($DebtorNo)` - returns error message if on stop
+  - `CheckCreditWatch($DebtorNo)` - returns warning message if on watch
+
+- **Balance calculations:**
+  - `GetCustomerBalance($DebtorNo)` - total outstanding balance
+  - `GetCustomerOverdueBalance($DebtorNo, $DaysOverdue)` - overdue portion
+  - `GetCustomerCreditLimit($DebtorNo)` - current limit
+
+- **Order validation:**
+  - `CheckCreditLimitWithOrder($DebtorNo, $OrderAmount, $Currency)` - checks if order exceeds limit
+  - Returns empty string if OK, error message if would exceed
+
+- **Reminder management:**
+  - `ShouldSendReminder($DebtorNo)` - checks if eligible for reminder (no stop, no disputes, has overdue balance)
+  - `GetLastReminderStage($DebtorNo)` - highest stage already sent
+  - `GetReminderLetterConfig($Stage)` - configuration for a stage
+
+- **Audit trail:**
+  - `RecordCreditAction($ActionType, $DebtorNo, $Details)` - logs actions
+
+**Usage:** Include this file in pages that need credit checks:
+```php
+include('includes/CreditControlFunctions.php');
+if (CheckCreditStop($DebtorNo)) {
+    prnMsg($message, 'error');
+    exit;
+}
+```
+
+## Integration Points
+
+### Critical: Order Entry and Processing
+
+All order-taking flows need credit status checks:
+
+1. **SelectOrderItems.php** (sales order entry)
+   - Add credit status check after customer selection
+   - Check `on_stop` status -> show error and block order
+   - Check `watch` status -> show warning but allow order
+   - Check over-limit -> hold for approval (new workflow)
+
+2. **ConfirmDispatch_Invoice.php** (invoice creation)
+   - Verify customer still not on stop before invoicing
+   - Re-check credit limit wasn't exceeded
+
+3. **CounterSales.php** (point-of-sale)
+   - Check credit status before accepting payment-in-advance cash sale
+   - Block if on stop
+
+4. **EDIProcessOrders.php** (EDI orders)
+   - Check credit status before auto-creating order
+   - Log rejected order with reason
+
+5. **RecurringSalesOrdersProcess.php** (standing orders)
+   - Check credit status before auto-generating order
+   - Skip customer if on stop, log reason
+
